  "text": "Veterinary Specialists — Animal Samaritans\n0\nSkip to Content\nVeterinary Care\nAbout Our Clinics\nRequest Appointment\nSpay and Neuter\nGeneral Practice Care\nUrgent Care\nPricing\nFinancial Aid\nFinancial Aid Application\nPayment Plans\nOnline Pharmacy\nOur Veterinary Staff\nSpecialty Services\nVeterinary Specialists\nOncology\nCardiology\nInternal Medicine\nShelter\nAdopt a Pet\nFoster Program\nPrograms & Education\nAnimal Rescue\nA.C.T. (Animal Companion Therapy)\nHumane Education\nFound Kittens?\nHow to Give\nCapital Campaign\nDonate\nVolunteer\nFoster an Animal\nPuppy & Kitten Supplies Wishlist\nPlanned Giving\nDonate Your Vehicle\nEvents\nAbout Us\nWhat We Do\nBoard of Directors\nCareers\nMedia\nFinancial Reports\nContact Us\nDonate\nOpen Menu\nClose Menu\nVeterinary Care\nAbout Our Clinics\nRequest Appointment\nSpay and Neuter\nGeneral Practice Care\nUrgent Care\nPricing\nFinancial Aid\nFinancial Aid Application\nPayment Plans\nOnline Pharmacy\nOur Veterinary Staff\nSpecialty Services\nVeterinary Specialists\nOncology\nCardiology\nInternal Medicine\nShelter\nAdopt a Pet\nFoster Program\nPrograms & Education\nAnimal Rescue\nA.C.T. (Animal Companion Therapy)\nHumane Education\nFound Kittens?\nHow to Give\nCapital Campaign\nDonate\nVolunteer\nFoster an Animal\nPuppy & Kitten Supplies Wishlist\nPlanned Giving\nDonate Your Vehicle\nEvents\nAbout Us\nWhat We Do\nBoard of Directors\nCareers\nMedia\nFinancial Reports\nContact Us\nDonate\nOpen Menu\nClose Menu\nFolder:\nVeterinary Care\nBack\nAbout Our Clinics\nRequest Appointment\nSpay and Neuter\nGeneral Practice Care\nUrgent Care\nPricing\nFinancial Aid\nFinancial Aid Application\nPayment Plans\nOnline Pharmacy\nOur Veterinary Staff\nFolder:\nSpecialty Services\nBack\nVeterinary Specialists\nOncology\nCardiology\nInternal Medicine\nFolder:\nShelter\nBack\nAdopt a Pet\nFoster Program\nFolder:\nPrograms & Education\nBack\nAnimal Rescue\nA.C.T. (Animal Companion Therapy)\nHumane Education\nFound Kittens?\nFolder:\nHow to Give\nBack\nCapital Campaign\nDonate\nVolunteer\nFoster an Animal\nPuppy & Kitten Supplies Wishlist\nPlanned Giving\nDonate Your Vehicle\nEvents\nFolder:\nAbout Us\nBack\nWhat We Do\nBoard of Directors\nCareers\nMedia\nFinancial Reports\nContact Us\nDonate\nAt\nAnimal Samaritans Veterinary Specialists\n, we provide advanced, compassionate care for pets facing complex medical conditions. Our specialty services are designed for cases that require a higher level of expertise, precision, and coordination — all delivered within a newly remodeled, state-of-the-art care facility.\nWith highly trained veterinarians dedicated to specific disciplines, advanced diagnostic technology, and a deeply compassionate approach, we’re here to give your pet the care they need at every stage of treatment.\nAnimal Samaritans Veterinary Specialists\nExpertise. Experience. Advanced Care.\nOur specialty team focuses on diagnosing and treating complex conditions with a level of care that goes beyond general practice.\nBoard-trained and highly experienced veterinary specialists\nAdvanced diagnostic and treatment equipment\nNewly remodeled specialty and urgent care facility\nCollaborative, personalized treatment plans\nClear communication and compassionate guidance for pet families\nEvery specialty service at Animal Samaritans is built around one goal: delivering the highest standard of care while supporting you and your pet through every step of the process.\nSpecialty Veterinary Services\nOncology\nA cancer diagnosis can be overwhelming. Our oncology team provides advanced diagnostic evaluation, individualized treatment plans, and ongoing support for pets with cancer. From chemotherapy and tumor management to supportive and palliative care, our specialists focus on improving quality of life while delivering the most effective treatment options available.\nCall to make an appointment\n760-332-5030\nLearn more about Oncology Services\nCardiology\nHeart conditions in pets require specialized diagnostics and ongoing management. Our cardiology specialists utilize advanced tools such as echocardiography, electrocardiograms, and blood pressure monitoring to accurately diagnose and manage cardiac disease, helping pets live longer, healthier lives.\nCall to make an appointment\n760-332-5032\nLearn more about Cardiology Services\nInternal Medicine\nFor complex, chronic, or difficult-to-diagnose conditions, our internal medicine specialists provide comprehensive evaluation and treatment. This includes gastrointestinal disease, endocrine disorders, immune-mediated conditions, liver and kidney disease, and other multi-system illnesses that require advanced expertise.\nCall to make an appointment\n760-332-5029\nLearn more about Internal Medicine Services\nGive Your Pet the Care They Need\nWhen your pet needs specialized medical care, you deserve a team you can trust. Animal Samaritans Veterinary Specialists combines experience, advanced technology, and compassionate care to support both pets and their families through even the most complex medical journeys.\nRequest an appointment today\nor explore our specialty services to learn how we can help your pet receive the highest level of care.\nThousand Palms Clinic and Administration:\n72-120 Pet Land Place\nThousand Palms, CA 92276\nThousand Palms Hours of Operation:\nMonday - Saturday\n8:00AM - 5:00PM\nIndio Clinic:\n42150 B Jackson Street, STE 106\nIndio, CA 92203\nIndio Hours of Operation:\nMonday - Friday\n8:00AM - 5:00PM\nAdoption Center:\n72307 Ramon Rd\nThousand Palms, CA 92276\nnmarin@animalsamaritans.org\n(760) 601-3918\nShelter Hours of Operation:\nMonday - Sunday\n10:00AM - 12:00PM; 1:00PM - 4:00PM\nContact Info:\n(760) 343-3477\nInfo@animalsamaritans.org\nAnimal Samaritans is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization\nFederal ID: 95-3171867\nWhat We Do\nBoard of Directors\nCareers\nMedia\nContact Us\nAdoption Center\nAnimal Rescue\nACT\nHumane Education\nAdopt a Pet\nFoster Program\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and Conditions\nAbout Our Clinics\nOncology\nCardiology\nInternal Medicine\nUrgent Care\nOnline Pharmacy\nDonate\nPlanned Giving\nCapital Campaign\nEvents\nVolunteer\nFinancial Aid",
